# S14 EEG Analysis

This notebook reads and analyzes the EDF recording `S14_EEG.edf`.

The analysis includes:

- EDF header inspection
- Digital-to-physical signal conversion
- Raw EEG visualization
- Descriptive statistics
- Power spectral density analysis
- EEG frequency-band power estimation

According to the EDF metadata, the recording contains the identifiers
`SIM` and `EEG-SIM`; therefore, it is treated as simulated EEG data.
